   297	`sum c_l = N - 1` containing at least one trivial and at least one `mu >= 2`
   298	carrier, plus an unordered partition into `m >= 2` owner blocks, with
   299	`W_i = sum_{l in block i} mu_l s_l`. Filters, in order:
